{#
  The front page: the page the Reading setting names, read at `/`, as the
  source design's `front-page.php` draws it (decision-16, TASK-85).

  A site's own words, then what it has been writing. The words are the page's
  rendered body and nothing else — no title, because `layouts/base.njk` heads
  the root path with the site title and a second `h1` under it would be one
  heading too many, and no Published line, because a front page is read as the
  site rather than as a page somebody wrote on a Tuesday. Then `Recent Posts`
  over the same feed a listing is made of, headed at 3 so the outline never
  skips a level, then the line of links, then the bio.

  A theme that wants a different front page replaces this file; a site that
  wants no front page of its own sets no homepage, and `/` is the listing.
#}
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{#- Who the bio credits, and what tells `layouts/base.njk` the site menu is in
    the bio rather than in the page footer. -#}
{% set bioAuthor = siteAuthor %}

{% block content %}
<div class="page-body e-content">
  {{ content | safe }}
</div>

<h2>Recent Posts</h2>
{#- The feed a listing prints, over the posts the CMS decided were recent:
    this month's writing when there is enough of it and the five newest
    otherwise. `feedHeading` is 3 because the `h2` above is what they sit
    under. -#}
{% set posts = recentPosts %}
{% set feedHeading = 3 %}
{% include "partials/post-list.njk" %}

{#- Where to go next. The posts page is here only when the site has one — on a
    site without one there is no second URL for the archive, and a link to one
    would be a link to nothing. Search belongs on this line too and is not
    written yet: TASK-22. -#}
{% if postsPage %}
<p class="front-links">
  <a href="{{ postsPage.url | url }}">{{ postsPage.title }}<span aria-hidden="true"> &rarr;</span></a>
</p>
{% endif %}

{% if bioAuthor %}
<hr>
<footer>
  {% include "partials/bio.njk" %}
</footer>
{% endif %}

{# A homepage may ask for a contact form like any other page (TASK-56). #}
{% if contactForm %}
{% include "partials/contact-form.njk" %}
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
